<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;Data sources&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everything Purview can scan: cloud, SaaS, on-prem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;Scan and extract metadata&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crawls without moving the underlying data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;Classify&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Runs sensitive info type matching.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;Data Map and catalog&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Searchable inventory of discovered assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;Label and protect&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sensitivity labels applied to content.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;DLP policy decision&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Allow, block, or warn based on policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;7. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d6b656&quot;&gt;Activity events and alerts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fed by both DLP decisions and AI interactions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;Unified audit log&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Single system of record for all activity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;9. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;DSPM, IRM, eDiscovery&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Downstream investigation and risk tooling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="140" width="320" height="620" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
